# Diagnostic, not a receipt: the gate's margin (physics catalog plan,
# 2026-10-04, "Gate keeps a forecast margin") against every frame above real
# time. Run with ?nodes=300&seed=7&links=none&gpu=off&physics_speed=max, and
# again with &physics_budget_margin_us=0 for the margin's control; Springs
# is applied eight times, each restarting its settle, so a run holds several
# hundred budget-bound frames.
assert snap ready == true
click role:button Play physics
settle 2
click role:combobox Arrangement
settle 1
click role:option Free (physics alone)
settle 1
click role:button Apply arrangement
settle 1
click role:combobox Physics law
settle 1
click role:option Springs
settle 1
click role:button Apply physics
settle 15
click role:button Apply physics
settle 15
click role:button Apply physics
settle 15
click role:button Apply physics
settle 15
click role:button Apply physics
settle 15
click role:button Apply physics
settle 15
click role:button Apply physics
settle 15
click role:button Apply physics
settle 15
log-pace diag
log diag speed margin complete
